optimizer.cpp adapts the noncapturable foreach and fused Adam operation order
from PyTorch 2.13.0, torch/optim/adam.py, and the foreach L2 clipping order from
torch/nn/utils/clip_grad.py. The implementation owns named FP32 state and calls
existing ATen kernels. Unsupported modes are intentionally rejected.

Upstream: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch
Installed oracle: 2.13.0+cu130
Upstream build commit: cf30153c4c131c8164ee7798e5022d810682e2cb
